      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start on the theory, but I really need the actual *voice* for a specific scene. I'm writing a scene where this official is addressing a group of local leaders who are protesting a new tax. Instead of just explaining the concept, can you write the actual speech he would give? I want to hear how he would actually talk to them—the tone, the way he might describe their \"nature\" or their \"lack of discipline\" compared to British order. I need to capture that specific sense of superiority they felt, even if it's uncomfortable to read today.",
